{"meta":{"ui":"itinerary","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","turn":"generate","prompt":"Plan two days in Kyoto as an inline itinerary: a timeline per day with times, places, how to get between them and how long it takes. Each stop expands for details, each day has a checklist of things to book that I can tick off, and a line at the top says how many are left.","text":"Column gap:12 pad:16 w:390\n  Text.title \"Kyoto: 2 days\"\n  state booked=0\n  Text.muted \"{2-booked} things left to book\"\n  Text.heading \"Day 1\"\n  Card gap:8\n    Accordion\n      ListTile \"09:00  Fushimi Inari\" \"Walk 20 min from station\"\n        Text.body \"Thousand torii gates, about 2 hours up the mountain trail. Go early to beat crowds.\"\n        Text.small \"Getting there: JR Nara Line to Inari, 5 min.\"\n      ListTile \"11:30  Nishiki Market\" \"Bus 5 min, about 10 min\"\n        Text.body \"Food alley with pickles, tofu and snacks. Lunch stop.\"\n        Text.small \"Getting there: bus 208 from Inari, about 10 min.\"\n      ListTile \"14:30  Kiyomizu-dera\" \"Bus 15 min, about 20 min\"\n        Text.body \"Wooden stage over the hillside and the old streets below.\"\n        Text.small \"Getting there: bus 206 from Shijo, about 20 min.\"\n      ListTile \"18:00  Gion evening walk\" \"Walk 15 min, about 15 min\"\n        Text.body \"Historic teahouse district, best after dusk.\"\n        Text.small \"Getting there: walk from Kiyomizu-dera, about 15 min.\"\n    Text.strong \"Book before you go\"\n    Checkbox \"Timed entry: Fushimi Inari\" -> booked=booked+1\n    Checkbox \"Kaiseki dinner in Gion\" -> booked=booked+1\n  Text.heading \"Day 2\"\n  Card gap:8\n    Accordion\n      ListTile \"08:30  Arashiyama bamboo grove\" \"Train 10 min, about 15 min\"\n        Text.body \"Quiet bamboo path, go before 9 to avoid crowds.\"\n        Text.small \"Getting there: JR Sagano Line to Saga-Arashiyama, 4 min.\"\n      ListTile \"10:30  Tenryu-ji\" \"Walk 5 min, about 10 min\"\n        Text.body \"Zen garden and temple with a famous pond garden.\"\n        Text.small \"Getting there: walk from the grove, about 10 min.\"\n      ListTile \"13:00  Philosopher's Path\" \"Bus 20 min, about 30 min\"\n        Text.body \"Canal walk lined with cherry trees, ends near temples.\"\n        Text.small \"Getting there: bus 93 from Arashiyama, about 20 min.\"\n      ListTile \"16:00  Nanzen-ji\" \"Walk 10 min, about 10 min\"\n        Text.body \"Large temple grounds and an aqueduct, relaxed end to the day.\"\n        Text.small \"Getting there: walk from the Philosopher's Path, about 10 min.\"\n    Text.strong \"Book before you go\"\n    Checkbox \"Tenryu-ji garden ticket\" -> booked=booked+1\n    Checkbox \"Train pass for Arashiyama\" -> booked=booked+1","usage":{"input_tokens":1829,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1017,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard","output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0}},"ttftMs":620,"totalMs":5243}}
